  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the mystery and fun of the outdoors with the Jeminise Bigfoot Quilt. Designed for adventure lovers and nature enthusiasts, this quilt brings warmth, comfort, and style to any bedroom or camping trip. Made from a soft and durable cotton and polyester blend, it's perfect for snuggling up on chilly nights or adding a unique touch to your home decor.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Bigfoot Design:</strong> Features an eye-catching Bigfoot design, ideal for nature enthusiasts, campers, and those who love the great outdoors.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Quality Material:</strong> Crafted from a soft, durable blend of cotton and polyester, ensuring a cozy and breathable sleeping experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile &amp; Functional:</strong> Perfect for year-round comfort, functioning as a warm blanket for cold nights or a stylish decorative piece.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit every bed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable fabric makes for simple maintenance and long-lasting use.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Built to Last:</strong> Designed with high-quality stitching and vibrant, fade-resistant prints for durability wash after wash.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An excellent gift for Bigfoot enthusiasts, nature lovers, or anyone who enjoys outdoor adventures.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Cotton Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Bigfoot Say Hi</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Rodeo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern Themed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) + (Optional) Pillowcases</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
